   "en": "The story will combine the legend of a demon king with a hero who crosses over time and other things. The comedy will involve traveling between a Japanese living room and another world.\n___\n**Links:**\n- Alternative Official Raw - [Niconico](http://seiga.nicovideo.jp/comic/42960)",
